      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:01Z",
      "text": ".xyz is a top-level domain name introduced through ICANN's new generic top-level domain (gTLD) Program.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1382089482:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:11Z",
      "text": "The .xyz domain is operated by XYZ, which is headquartered in Las Vegas, United States.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q16049593:P137"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:19Z",
      "text": "The .xyz domain was founded in 2014.",
      "cites": [
        "wd:Q16049593:P571"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:29Z",
      "text": "English Wikipedia had 254,329 readers of .xyz on 4 November 2026, about 4× the usual.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:.xyz:2026-11-04",
        "views:en:.xyz:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-04T00:00:36Z",
      "text": "The article is read in 11 languages, and after English, Japanese is the most common with 15 readers.",
